  "notes": "Measurement design follows docs/notes/phase0-fixtures.md, Baseline harness handoff, and docs/CLEAN-ROOM.md, Inputs and handoff. Implementation was independently derived; selectors and statuses came from the public entry markup and live editor UI. Runtime fingerprinting processed opaque bytes only. PDF readers and the existing browser verification were exercised black-box, not used as implementation sources. The baseline measures first canvas paint, page count, first-page rotation and available structural checks, not feature fidelity or release readiness. Full-run manifest and app fingerprints are recorded in docs/baseline/results.json.",
